--TEST--
an enum body takes cases, methods and constants, and never a property: a case is an integer and has nowhere to keep a value, so a property is refused at the property and the help names a class or a method (`rule:enums/an-enum-body-takes-methods-and-constants`)
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

enum Size {
    Small,
    Large,

    public const string DEFAULT_LABEL = "small";

    public string $label = "small";

    public static ?Size $chosen = null;
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0220]: an enum has no properties
%A
error[E0220]: an enum has no properties
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
